    "updated_at": "2023-01-19T07:59:42Z",
    "body": "No, if we change Fetch to return a basic filtered response for navigations HTML doesn't need any changes because it doesn't inspect `Set-Cookie` headers. (A basic filtered response only filters out `Set-Cookie` and `Set-Cookie2` headers.)\r\n\r\nEverything below that was rationale for why that would be okay and how we could improve upon it, but also why that improvement wouldn't be black-box-distinguishable and therefore somewhat questionable as a time investment.",
